@startuml sequence-structured-identity
!include common.iuml
title 结构化顺序图：GET /api/apps/{code}/auth/me（课程系统查询当前用户权限）
autonumber
participant "课程后端\nBearerAuthenticationFilter" as CB
participant "ApplicationIdentityController" as C
participant "ApplicationIdentityService" as S
participant "BusinessSystemRepository" as BR
participant "UserAccountRepository" as UR
participant "UserRoleRepository" as URR
participant "RoleHierarchyService" as H
participant "AuthorizationService" as Z
participant "PermissionApiRepository" as PR
CB -> C : GET /api/apps/cpm/auth/me（用户本人 JWT）
C -> S : current(userId, "cpm")
activate S
S -> BR : findByCode("cpm")
S -> UR : findById(userId)
S -> URR : findAllByUser_Id(userId)
S -> H : graph() ; resolve(角色, graph)
H --> S : 有效角色（停用角色阻断路径）
S -> Z : effective(userId)
Z --> S : 有效前端权限（直接 ∪ 继承）
S -> S : 过滤本应用权限，收集 MCO、MCOR…
loop 每个有效权限
  S -> PR : findAllByPermission_Id(id)
  S -> S : 收集启用资源的权限码 CV、CR…
end
S --> C : IdentityData.Current
deactivate S
C --> CB : {subject, roles, permissions}
note over CB : 课程后端把 permissions 装入 Spring Security 权限，\n按 TC、CV 等判断接口是否放行
@enduml
